Z||000001||fieroshop||05-04-2000||10:41 AM||||Well lets see it could be  an 88 or wait an 87 no no no no it is an 86  were there any 89 built? From you discription it could be any year. Look at the serial number and toward s the end there are six numbers. Just in front of those last six numbers are two letters. Usually something like GP or JP or HP.<BR>The G stands for an 86, H is for 87 and J is for 88. So go out and look and you tell us what year.<p>[This message has been edited by fieroshop (edited 05-04-2000).]||||reg||1
